# Whyscape cloud repo — ALLOWLIST (22 Nov 2026). Everything is ignored unless re-included below.
# Excluded on purpose: node_modules, Whisper model (lives outside the project), all MP4 finals, WAV stems/mixes,
# arsip/, _checkpoint/, _migrasi/, _bukan_whyscape/, kaizen/, docs/ (third-party reference videos), other episodes.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/HANDOFF.md
!/automation/
!/series/
!/episodes/
/episodes/*
!/episodes/_template_epXX/
!/episodes/ep13_lebah_pulang/
!/episodes/ep14_kulkas/
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/

# never, anywhere
client_secret*.json
*oauth*token*
*.token.json
credentials*.json
*.wav
*.mp4
*.mov
*.onnx
*.tar.bz2
*.zip
.env*
*.key
*.pem
**/settings.local.json
**/out/
**/qc/
**/stills/
**/final/
**/__pycache__/
**/_*.log
outputs/
